        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Saag aloo serves 4 and takes about 35 minutes. Parboil the potato first so it finishes evenly with the spinach. Keep the heat steady so the potato browns at the edges."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Add the spinach in handfuls and let each batch wilt before the next."
