          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Where this dish lives"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Saag aloo is a humble side across North India. It uses two cheap, common ingredients. The greens and potato fill out any meal. Serve it with dal and roti. It is a good way to use up spinach."
          }
        ]
      }
